      "content": "i get that, but being \"neutral\" feels like it's actually hurting us more than helping. it's making us look out of touch with where the world is going. if we don't take a stand for the bill, doesn't that basically signal we don't care about the planet? isn't staying silent essentially a vote against the protections in the bill? won't that eventually become a bigger PR disaster than just losing a few grumpy customers?",
